blocked-before-dispatch refusal omits XYZ_ARCHIVE_ROOT", "section": "Queue / parked intake", "position": 16, "status_marker": "🆕", "doc_path": "PROJECT/1-INBOX/GH-255-ARCHIVE-ROOT-REMEDY.md", "issue_url": "https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/255", "raw_text": "- **GH-255 — marathon-drive blocked-before-dispatch refusal omits XYZ_ARCHIVE_ROOT** (2026-08-26) - the refusal named --target-root and un-ignore but never XYZ_ARCHIVE_ROOT, the knob GH-30 built for exactly the repo it fires on; cost three dead-end launch attempts on a consuming repo. Reported from rebalanceOS. Issue [#255](https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/255). -> [PROJECT/1-INBOX/GH-255-ARCHIVE-ROOT-REMEDY.md](PROJECT/1-INBOX/GH-255-ARCHIVE-ROOT-REMEDY.md) rated 1/1/1/1", "status_label_supported": true, "status_label": null, "rating_pri": 1, "rating_sev": 1, "rating_appeal": 1, "rating_effort": 1, "rating_ovr": null, "risk": null}, {"global_id": "rmi-01M0ZA408NRF4EAD9SP0VX6C2F", "gh_number": 256, "title": "No preflight checks the builder can reach a phase artifact paths", "section": "Queue / parked intake", "position": 17, "status_marker": "🆕", "doc_path": "PROJECT/1-INBOX/GH-256-ARTIFACT-REACHABILITY-PREFLIGHT.md", "issue_url": "https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/256", "raw_text": "- **GH-256 — no preflight checks the builder can reach a phase's artifact paths** (2026-08-26) - under --target-root the shim guarded the harness while the worktree was the target, so four builder turns wrote nothing and the phase burned its round cap in silence. Reported from rebalanceOS. Issue [#256](https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/256). -> [PROJECT/1-INBOX/GH-256-ARTIFACT-REACHABILITY-PREFLIGHT.md](PROJECT/1-INBOX/GH-256-ARTIFACT-REACHABILITY-PREFLIGHT.md) rated 3/2/2/1", "status_label_supported": true, "status_label": null, "rating_pri": 3, "rating_sev": 2, "rating_appeal": 2, "rating_effort": 1, "rating_ovr": null, "risk": null}, {"global_id": "rmi-01M10H2T4VH78WXCH0Z4S9CVDQ", 