bel_supported": true, "status_label": null, "rating_pri": 50, "rating_sev": 50, "rating_appeal": 50, "rating_effort": 50, "rating_ovr": null, "risk": null}, {"global_id": "rmi-01M1T8H5J5P8TZ9Y5M194E91JN", "gh_number": 454, "title": "wave_reconcile dies on an unnamed release, and enforces PDDA full-mode on an observe-mode repo", "section": "Queue / parked intake", "position": 54, "status_marker": "🆕", "doc_path": "PROJECT/2-WORKING/GH-454-RECONCILE-GATE-DEFECTS.md", "issue_url": "https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/454", "raw_text": "- **GH-454 · wave_reconcile dies on an unnamed release, and enforces PDDA full-mode on an observe-mode repo** 🆕 **captured 2026-09-05 via /file-xyz-bug from `rebalanceOS`** — two defects, one run, each rolling the whole wave back: `export_timeline.py:278` does `(codename or version).lower()` and raises on a release row with both NULL; `run_validation_gate()` fails on any stdout line containing `ERROR`, ignoring `pdda.sh`'s mode-aware exit code and so enforcing `full` on a repo that declares `observe`. Both have workarounds the caller must already know. With GH-215's surviving half, this is what blocks GH-421 unattended operation. rated 72/78/80/78 — [GH-454-RECONCILE-GATE-DEFECTS.md](PROJECT/2-WORKING/GH-454-RECONCILE-GATE-DEFECTS.md)", "status_label_supported": true, "status_label": null, "rating_pri": 72, "rating_sev": 78, "rating_appeal": 80, "rating_effort": 78, "rating_ovr": null, "risk": null}, {"global_id": "rmi-01M1VVTQ9SZVD1DSZJF9CS6PPR", "gh_number": 460, "title": "ATE/Fuzz campaign vs the model-alias resolver — counterexamples must land as fixes", "section": "Queue / parked intake", "position": 55, "status_marker": "🆕", "doc_path": "PROJECT/2-WORKING/GH-460-ATE-FUZZ-RESOLVER-CAMPAIGN.md", "issue_url": "https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/460", "raw_text": "- **GH-460 · ATE/Fuzz campaign vs the model-alias resolver — counterexamples must land as fixes** — rated 60/40/50/70 — Gen4 fuzz engine as a standing oracle over resolve-model-alias.sh; committed smoke + seeded campaigns; every counterexample → fix+regression test or documented non-defect. [issue](https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/460) · [doc](PROJECT/2-WORKING/GH-460-ATE-FUZZ-RESOLVER-CAMPAIGN.md)", "status_label_supported": true, "status_label": null, "rating_pri": 60, "rating_sev": 40, "rating_appeal": 50, "rating_effort": 70, "rating_ovr": null, "risk": null}, {"global_id": "rmi-01M1TCY9N489VPX9H9QZ0J0A1F", "gh_number": 453, "title": "Governance document identity audit", "section": "Queue / parked intake", "position": 55, "status_marker": "🆕", "doc_path": "PROJECT/2-WORKING/GH-453-GOVERNANCE-IDENTITY-AUDIT.md", "issue_url": "https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/453", "raw_text": "- **GH-453 · Governance document identity audit** — Local Stage 2 corrections implemented and verified; awaiting delivery. [Plan](PROJECT/2-WORKING/GH-453-GOVERNANCE-IDENTITY-AUDIT.md) · [#453](https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/453) (rated 70/65/50/55)", "status_label_supported": true, "status_label": null, "rating_pri": 70, "rating_sev": 65, "rating_appeal": 50, "rating_effort": 55, "rating_ovr": null, "risk": null}, {"global_id": "rmi-01M1YHJA1ECY34JSBP64M5S543", "gh_number": 484, "title": "Deploy Skills", "section": "Queue / parked intake", "position": 57, "status_marker": "🆕", "doc_path": "PROJECT/2-WORKING/GH-484-DEPLOY-SKILLS.md", "issue_url": "https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/484", "raw_text": "- **GH-484 · Deploy Skills** — plan QA with Agy; implementation not started · [plan](PROJECT/2-WORKING/GH-484-DEPLOY-SKILLS.md) · [#484](https://github.com/HiQS-Labs/XYZ-forge/issues/484) (rated 72/58/50/55)", "status_label_supported": true, "status_label": null, "rating_pri": 72, "rating_sev": 58, "rating_appeal": 50, "rating_effort": 55, "rating_ovr": null, "risk": null}, {"global_id": "rmi-01M1YH2AKWMHAMXMS8MWJSA8Q6", "gh_number": 481, "title": "consult.sh: agy lane answered from a months-o